## TIẾNG ANH · 16:30–17:00 — Thứ Tư: Kể chuyện kỹ thuật

### 16:40–16:55 · Nói to có ghi âm

**Chủ đề: một thứ bạn đã xây rồi tự xóa.**

Đây là dạng câu hỏi *"tell me about a time you changed your mind"* — rất hay được hỏi và rất ít người trả lời tốt.

> *"This week I added animations to the app, and by the end of the second day I had more than I needed.*
> *So I made a table of every animation and forced myself to write, next to each one, what question it answers for the user. The progress bar filling in answers 'how much did that change.' A row sliding in answers 'where did my new entry go.' A bouncing logo on the loading screen answers nothing — it was there because I thought it looked nice.*
> *I deleted the ones with an empty second column, in their own commit so it's visible in the history.*
> *I also added a check for the system reduce-motion setting. People turn that on for medical reasons, not preference. When it's on, I don't remove the feedback entirely — I switch from sliding to fading, so the user still knows something changed.*
> *The general thing I took from it: adding is easy, and the discipline is in removing."*

### 16:55–17:00 · 5 từ mới

| Từ / cụm | Nghĩa | Câu mẫu |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `answers the question` | trả lời được câu hỏi | *What question does it answer?* |
| `for medical reasons` | vì lý do y tế | *People turn it on for medical reasons.* |
| `in its own commit` | trong một commit riêng | *I deleted them in their own commit.* |
| `visible in the history` | thấy được trong lịch sử | *So it's visible in the git history.* |
| `the discipline is in` | cái khó nằm ở | *The discipline is in removing.* |

